---
permalink: /nav-preview/
noindex: true
title: "Nav preview | Locations mega menu"
description: "Internal review page for the proposed Locations mega menu and the header Order Online CTA. Not a shipping page."
---
{#
  REVIEW PAGE. Not wired into the site.

  The live header on all fifteen pages is unchanged: it still renders
  components/site-header.njk from nav.primary, four items, as signed off. This
  page is the only place the five-item mega-menu header exists, so the change
  can be looked at before it goes everywhere.

  Delete this file, nav-preview-frame.njk, and nav.primaryProposed to reject.
  See nav.json `_proposedNote` to adopt.
#}
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="{{ site.locale }}" data-mode="{{ site.theme.mode }}" data-fonts="{{ site.theme.fonts }}" data-pattern="{{ site.theme.pattern }}">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>{{ title }}</title>
  <meta name="description" content="{{ description }}">
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://cdn.circulationstudio.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bebas+Neue&family=Barlow+Condensed:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;0,600;0,700;1,600&family=Barlow:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <script type="module" src="/src/js/main.js"></script>
  <style>
    .rv { max-width: 90rem; margin-inline: auto; padding: var(--space-8) var(--layout-gutter); }
    .rv h2 { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: var(--text-h3); text-transform: uppercase;
             letter-spacing: var(--tracking-display); color: var(--color-ink); margin-bottom: var(--space-2); }
    .rv h3 { font-family: var(--font-ui); font-size: var(--text-micro); letter-spacing: var(--tracking-widest);
             text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--color-red); margin-bottom: var(--space-4); }
    .rv p { font-family: var(--font-cond); font-weight: var(--weight-light); font-size: var(--text-small);
            line-height: var(--leading-normal); color: var(--color-ink-2); max-width: 46rem; }
    .rv__rule { border: 0; border-top: var(--stroke-hair) solid var(--color-rule); margin: var(--space-9) 0; }
    .rv__stage { border: var(--stroke-hair) solid var(--color-rule-strong); background: var(--color-canvas);
                 margin-top: var(--space-5); position: relative; }
    .rv__stage-label { position: absolute; top: 0; right: 0; z-index: 2; background: var(--color-red);
                       color: var(--color-system-cream); font-family: var(--font-ui); font-weight: var(--weight-semibold);
                       font-size: var(--text-micro); letter-spacing: var(--tracking-wider); text-transform: uppercase;
                       padding: var(--space-1) var(--space-3); }
    .rv__frame { width: 390px; height: 760px; border: 0; display: block; background: var(--color-canvas); }
    .rv__phone { width: 390px; border: var(--stroke-hair) solid var(--color-rule-strong); margin-top: var(--space-5); }
    .rv__cols { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr) auto; gap: var(--space-8); align-items: start; }
    @media (max-width: 64rem) { .rv__cols { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
    .rv__note { border-left: var(--stroke-rule) solid var(--color-red); padding-left: var(--space-4);
                margin-top: var(--space-5); }
    .rv__list { font-family: var(--font-cond); font-weight: var(--weight-light); font-size: var(--text-small);
                color: var(--color-ink-2); line-height: var(--leading-normal); margin-top: var(--space-4);
                padding-left: var(--space-5); }
    .rv__list li { margin-bottom: var(--space-2); }
    .rv__list code { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.9em; color: var(--color-ink); }
    .rv__ba { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0,16rem)); gap: var(--space-6); margin-top: var(--space-5); }
    .rv__ba-label { font-family: var(--font-ui); font-size: var(--text-micro); letter-spacing: var(--tracking-widest);
                    text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--color-ink-3); margin-bottom: var(--space-3); }
    .rv__ba-label--now { color: var(--color-red); }
    .rv__ba-card { display: flex; flex-direction: column; background: var(--color-canvas-3);
                   border: var(--stroke-hair) solid var(--color-rule); padding: 0 0 var(--space-3); }
    .rv__ba-media { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; aspect-ratio: 4/3;
                    background: var(--color-canvas); border-bottom: var(--stroke-hair) solid var(--color-rule);
                    font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: var(--text-h3); color: var(--color-ink-4); }
    .rv__ba-name { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: var(--text-h4); text-transform: uppercase;
                   letter-spacing: var(--tracking-display); color: var(--color-ink); padding: var(--space-4) var(--space-4) 0; }
    .rv__ba-hood { font-family: var(--font-cond); font-weight: var(--weight-light); font-size: var(--text-micro);
                   color: var(--color-ink-3); padding: var(--space-1) var(--space-4) var(--space-2); }
    .rv__ba-hoodline { display: flex; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: var(--space-2);
                       font-family: var(--font-cond); font-weight: var(--weight-light);
                       font-size: var(--text-micro); color: var(--color-ink-3);
                       padding: var(--space-2) var(--space-4) var(--space-4); }
    .rv__ba-sep { color: var(--color-ink-4); }
    .rv__ba-pills { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: var(--space-2); margin: 0 var(--space-3); }
    .rv__ba-pill { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: var(--space-2);
                   border: var(--stroke-hair) solid var(--color-rule-strong); border-radius: 999px;
                   font-family: var(--font-ui); font-weight: var(--weight-medium); font-size: var(--text-micro);
                   letter-spacing: var(--tracking-wide); text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--color-ink-2); }
    .rv__ba-pill--solo { margin: 0 var(--space-3); color: var(--color-ink); padding: var(--space-2) var(--space-4); }
    .rv__surfaces { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0,1fr)); gap: var(--space-6); margin-top: var(--space-5); }
    .rv__surface { border: var(--stroke-hair) solid var(--color-rule); padding: var(--space-5); background: var(--color-canvas-2); }
    @media (max-width: 48rem) { .rv__ba, .rv__surfaces { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
    /* Forces the panel open for the static desktop view, without JS. */
    .rv__forced .mega__panel[hidden] { display: block; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to content</a>

  {# ---------- 1. The real thing, interactive ---------- #}
  {% include "components/site-header-mega.njk" %}

  <main id="main">
    <div class="rv">
      <h3>Review page, not live</h3>
      <h2>Locations mega menu</h2>
      <p>
        The header above is live and interactive. Click or hover <strong>Locations</strong>.
        Tab to it and press Enter, Space, or Down. Escape closes it and returns focus to the trigger.
        The rest of the site still runs the signed four-item header, unchanged.
      </p>

      <div class="rv__note">
        <p>
          <strong>Order Online</strong> is now a top-level item, styled as the header's single red CTA.
          It is the third-biggest page on the site at 5,648 clicks and currently has no header link at all.
          Because the header now spends the red, page heroes must not put a second red beside it.
        </p>
      </div>

      <hr class="rv__rule">

      {# ---------- 2. Desktop, forced open ---------- #}
      <h3>Desktop, panel open</h3>
      <h2>Seven rooms</h2>
      <p>
        Rendered open without JavaScript so it can be read as a static layout. Cards come from
        <code>locations.json</code>. North Park is absent because it is not in that file, which is the
        right reason: nothing has to remember to exclude it.
      </p>
      <div class="rv__stage rv__forced">
        <span class="rv__stage-label">Desktop</span>
        <div style="position: relative;">
          {% set megaInstance = "static-" %}
          {% include "components/site-header-mega.njk" %}
        </div>
        <div style="height: 26rem;" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      </div>

      <hr class="rv__rule">

      {# ---------- 2b. Directions treatment ---------- #}
      <h3>Directions, folded into the neighborhood line</h3>
      <h2>One button, everything else quiet</h2>
      <p>
        Directions was a second pill, then a standalone link row. It is now part of the neighborhood
        line, separated by the middot the design system already uses elsewhere. Muted, no underline
        at rest, small external-link glyph. The card has exactly one thing that looks like a button.
      </p>

      <div class="rv__ba">
        <div>
          <p class="rv__ba-label">Before, two pills</p>
          <div class="rv__ba-card">
            <span class="rv__ba-media" aria-hidden="true">01</span>
            <span class="rv__ba-name">Convoy</span>
            <span class="rv__ba-hood">Kearny Mesa</span>
            <span class="rv__ba-pills" aria-hidden="true">
              <span class="rv__ba-pill">Order online</span>
              <span class="rv__ba-pill">Directions</span>
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="rv__ba-label rv__ba-label--now">After</p>
          <div class="rv__ba-card">
            <span class="rv__ba-media" aria-hidden="true">01</span>
            <span class="rv__ba-name">Convoy</span>
            <p class="rv__ba-hoodline">
              Kearny Mesa
              <span class="rv__ba-sep" aria-hidden="true">&middot;</span>
              <a class="link-quiet" href="{{ locations.items[0] | mapsUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Directions<span class="u-visually-hidden">, opens in a new tab</span><svg width="9" height="9" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 1.5h7.5V9M12.5 1.5 5.5 8.5M9 12.5H1.5V5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></a>
            </p>
            <span class="rv__ba-pill rv__ba-pill--solo" aria-hidden="true">Order online</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="rv__note">
        <p>
          One thing to weigh. With no colour difference and no underline at rest, the external-link
          glyph is the <em>only</em> cue that Directions is a link. It is a real non-colour
          distinction so it clears WCAG 1.4.1, but it is a quiet one. The underline returns on hover
          and focus and the focus ring is untouched, so keyboard users get both. If it reads as too
          buried when you look at it, giving it the red at rest is one line.
        </p>
      </div>

      <h3 style="margin-top: var(--space-8);">The same fold on the live surfaces</h3>
      <p>
        Not applied yet. Rendered with the real classes so it looks exactly as it will.
      </p>

      <div class="rv__surfaces">
        <div class="rv__surface">
          <p class="rv__ba-label">/locations/ card, proposed</p>
          <p class="rv__ba-name" style="font-size: var(--text-h4); padding: 0;">Convoy <em style="color: var(--color-red); font-style: normal;">The original</em></p>
          <p class="rv__ba-hoodline" style="padding: var(--space-2) 0 0;">
            Kearny Mesa
            <span class="rv__ba-sep" aria-hidden="true">&middot;</span>
            <a class="link-quiet" href="{{ locations.items[0] | mapsUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Directions<span class="u-visually-hidden">, opens in a new tab</span><svg width="9" height="9" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 1.5h7.5V9M12.5 1.5 5.5 8.5M9 12.5H1.5V5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></a>
          </p>
          <p style="font-family: var(--font-cond); font-weight: var(--weight-light); font-size: var(--text-small); color: var(--color-ink-2); margin: var(--space-3) 0;">
            The room Sam took over in 2001. Communal tables, the full menu, the expanded izakaya.
          </p>
          <p style="font-family: var(--font-cond); font-size: var(--text-micro); color: var(--color-ink-3);">4681 Convoy Street STE H, San Diego, CA 92111-2330</p>
        </div>

        <div class="rv__surface">
          <p class="rv__ba-label">Location page plate, proposed</p>
          <p style="font-family: var(--font-ui); font-size: var(--text-micro); letter-spacing: var(--tracking-widest); text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--color-ink-3);">Address</p>
          <p style="font-family: var(--font-cond); font-size: var(--text-body); color: var(--color-ink-2);">
            4681 Convoy Street STE H, San Diego, CA 92111-2330
            <span class="rv__ba-sep" aria-hidden="true">&middot;</span>
            <a class="link-quiet" style="font-size: var(--text-small);" href="{{ locations.items[0] | mapsUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Directions<span class="u-visually-hidden">, opens in a new tab</span><svg width="9" height="9" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 1.5h7.5V9M12.5 1.5 5.5 8.5M9 12.5H1.5V5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></a>
          </p>
          <p style="font-family: var(--font-cond); font-size: var(--text-micro); color: var(--color-ink-3); margin-top: var(--space-4);">
            The plate has no neighborhood line, so Directions folds onto the <strong>address</strong> value
            instead, which is the nearest equivalent. Its standalone Directions row goes away.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <hr class="rv__rule">

      {# ---------- 3. Mobile, real viewport ---------- #}
      <div class="rv__cols">
        <div>
          <h3>Mobile, 390px</h3>
          <h2>Inline, not overlaid</h2>
          <p>
            A real iframe at phone width, not a scaled screenshot, so the media queries and tap
            targets behave as they would on the device. Open Locations inside it.
          </p>
          <p style="margin-top: var(--space-4);">
            On a phone the panel stops floating and expands inline, pushing the page down. A fixed
            overlay would fight the sticky header and hide the page behind it. Below 26rem the cards
            go to one per row, media on the left, so the name and the order button both stay on one line.
          </p>

          <h3 style="margin-top: var(--space-8);">What to check</h3>
          <ul class="rv__list">
            <li>Keyboard: Tab to Locations, Enter to open, Tab through the seven cards and their order buttons, Escape to close.</li>
            <li>Focus is trapped inside the panel while open, as asked. Worth knowing the WAI-ARIA pattern for disclosure navigation is the opposite, Tab moves out and closes. Escape always works, so it is not a dead end. One function to switch.</li>
            <li>Reduced motion: the open animation only exists inside <code>prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference</code>, so it is absent rather than suppressed.</li>
            <li>Every <em>Order online</em> button goes to <code>/order-online/#slug</code>, never to Toast. Those URLs are still unverified.</li>
            <li>Placeholder media is drawn, not a stock photo standing in for real work.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="rv__phone">
          <iframe class="rv__frame" src="/nav-preview-frame/" title="Mobile preview of the header at 390 pixels wide" loading="lazy"></iframe>
        </div>
      </div>

      <hr class="rv__rule">

      <h3>Still open</h3>
      <p>
        Seven direct Toast links were deliberately not used. Once the click-test happens, changing
        <code>loc-card__order</code> to point at <code>loc.orderUrl</code> is a one-line change, and
        <code>/order-online/</code> stays as the fallback for Maui, which has no ordering URL on record.
      </p>
    </div>
  </main>

  <script type="module" src="/src/js/mega-menu.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
